  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you hit a creature with your natural weapons while raging, the beast within you can curse it with rabid fury. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw (DC 8 plus your Constitution modifier and Proficiency Bonus) or suffer one of the following effects (your choice).</p><ul><li>It must use its Reaction to make a melee attack against another creature of your choice that you can see.</li><li>It takes 2d12 Psychic damage.</li></ul><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
